          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5aa15fa8-99a7-56a4-8237-f605177275dd"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition. At 10th level, the penalty increases to –2. However, you gain spirit resistance equal to your level and a +2 status bonus to saving throws against spirits or haunts and effects that would give you the "
